OL,3,GNEWSAResidents disturbed by early
OL,4,Amorning tree felling
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living near a train line say
OL,7,Fthey have been left with a "lunar
OL,8,Flandscape" and disturbed sleep after
OL,9,Ftrees were cut down in the early hours
OL,10,Fof the morning.
OL,12,FTyne and Wear Metro operator carried
OL,13,Fout the works near Percy Avenue as part
OL,14,Fof a major line closure, the Local
OL,15,FDemocracy Reporting Service said.
OL,17,FSteven Shiel, head of rail
OL,18,Finfrastructure maintenance at Nexus,
OL,19,Fsaid the work at Cullercoats was
OL,20,F"essential for the management" of the
OL,21,Fline, with the trees posing a "risk to
OL,22,Fthe safety of our railway".
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
